# Menu to Factory reset (item 2 with one saved network); hold asks; hold again inside 10 s confirms.
# Then: ask, short press cancels; then ask and let the 10 s lapse, hold asks again.
start 1000
set saved 1
set saved_wifi 1
set online 1
set wifi 1
set usb 1
press 2000 3700
press 4000 4100
press 5000 5100
press 6000 7700
press 9000 10700
press 12000 12100
press 14000 14100
press 15000 15100
press 16000 17700
press 20000 21700
press 25000 26700
press 38000 39700
tick 1000 45000 20
